                <note rend="inline" type="source">411.12P/417: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Tobin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-16T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16, 1928—2
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>27. Your 31, June 16, 11 a.m. On behalf of this Government please express to
                    Minister of Foreign Affairs appropriate appreciation of action taken.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
